00:01:28.139 --> 00:01:29.239
&gt;&gt; Sean: DON'T OTHER PEOPLE IN

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:32.175
HER WORLD SAY, "LOOK, ROSIE, WE

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:35.211
