00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:57.801
AND I WOULD BE HAPPY TO SIT

00:01:57.802 --> 00:02:00.136
CROSS FROM HER AND SAY, "I

00:02:00.137 --> 00:02:00.670
DISAGREE.

